Sections 3 (g), 3 (h), 4, 5, 8, 9 and 11 survive termination.

## 8. Warranty disclaimer

THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS" AND WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, WHETHER
EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A
PARTICULAR PURPOSE, TITLE AND NON-INFRINGEMENT OF THIRD-PARTY RIGHTS. IF THIS
DISCLAIMER IS INEFFECTIVE UNDER APPLICABLE LAW, IT APPLIES TO THE FULLEST EXTENT
PERMITTED.

The software records nutritional values for the user's own purposes, and those
values are estimates produced by a language model from a photograph or a
sentence. They are not measurements. No assurance is given that they are
accurate, and they must not be relied upon where accurate nutritional
information matters. The software is not a medical device, gives no medical,
dietary or nutritional advice, and is not a substitute for professional advice.

The software talks to an AI provider chosen by the user, using access the user
obtained themselves. That provider is a third party. Its availability, its
results, its terms and any charges it makes are its own affair and not the
licensor's, and this license grants no rights in it.

